{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["דשא — all kinds of grasses together are called דשא, and each kind individually is called עשב." "עושה פרי למינו — by the plain sense למינו is stated for the grasses, for the למינו written in עץ עושה פרי applies also to עשב מזריע זרע." "עושה פרי למינו — an apple tree produces apples, not dates." "אשר זרעו בו — inside the apple there are seeds from which one can plant a tree for every kind of fruit."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T23:16:57.597632056Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}